\ltrch\fcs0 \i\insrsid16669361 1.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b0\i\insrsid16669361  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\insrsid16669361 Competencia
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\qj \li0\ri55\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin55\lin0\itap0 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs20\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs28\lang3082\langfe3082\cgrid\langnp3082\langfenp3082 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
